<title>USA: TAT Technologies sells interest in Aryt.</title>
<headline>TAT Technologies sells interest in Aryt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>TAT Technologies Ltd said Thursday that it has sold a controlling interest in Aryt Industries Ltd, recording a capital gain of $280,000.</p>
<p>The company sold 1,080,000 of the 1,333,488 shares it had held in Aryt in open market transactions.</p>
